{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1a4bd2b9-9ede-8da0-81b2-71144b397713",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T11:55:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:53:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:53:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Mr. Sousa. My name is Janice Peckham. I would like to inquire about water in my cellar following last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that down. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 93 Eustis Avenue, in Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:53:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 93 Eustis. And what happened, water came into the cellar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A few inches of water seeped in on Sunday morning. In all the years I have lived in this house, that has never happened. Not once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:53:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, okay. A few inches, so you had to deal with that. Did it come up through the floor or in from the walls, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:54:02-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It came in along the base of the back wall, as best I can tell. I was told afterward by a neighbor that it happens every big rain. I find it difficult to understand why I was never told this, and why nothing has been done about the drainage on the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's fair. So that'd be the street drain side of things. Is there a catch basin near your house, and was it clogged or backed up that you saw?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:54:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a drain at the corner, and it was covered with leaves and debris on Sunday. I did not touch it. I would simply like someone to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Leaves over the drain at the corner by 93 Eustis, water in the cellar Sunday. I'll put in a request for a crew to check and clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I would also ask for a call back when it is done, please. I would like to know that someone has actually been there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:55:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:55:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-nine. Good. Anything else going on down there, or is that it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:55:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is all for now. I should get back to what I was doing. I am repainting a dollhouse for my granddaughter, and the paint is drying while I am on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:55:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well don't let me hold you up. We'll get that request in today and somebody will call you once the crew's been out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I appreciate it. Good day, Mr. Sousa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Peckham. Bye now."
    }
  ],
